                                                "sense_id": "ee6ed08a-2de2-35b6-b176-6b0660ac0710",
                                                "text": "Stayed in her own house, searched her body each morning and examined her conscience each night for progressive symptoms of the metastasis she feared was in her."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f09c091b-12cf-36bb-a90b-c1638dd2c871",
                                        "entry_id": "26c5b124-e8f6-3e00-8e1f-ef6b378bf717",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The spread of something harmful to another location, like the metastasis of a cancer."
